# tools/build/ holds build-critical tooling (public_api_manifest.csv, the
# linker script, generate_lwip_headers.py, the patches, etc.) and IS tracked.
# Only genuine scratch/caches under it are ignored (.docstring_cache below;
# __pycache__/ is covered globally above). Note the root-anchored /build/ rule
# above: an unanchored "build/" silently swallowed this whole tree.

